{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_21_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，王正月，庚申，曹伯終生卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"桓無王，其曰王何也？正終生之卒也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，葬曹桓公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"三、秋，公會衞侯於桃丘，弗遇。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"弗遇者，志不相得也。弗，內辭也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，丙午，齊侯、衞侯、鄭伯來戰於郎。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_21_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_21","textTraditional":"來戰者，前定之戰也。內不言戰，言戰則敗也。不言其人，以吾敗也。不言及者，為內諱也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}